> Did I just get
> really unlucky or did I do something wrong?

That isn't even unlucky.  Also, if you decide a game was
unlucky you'll fail to learn any lesson so you won't improve.
This game's mistake: Wrong staircase.  Down is NOT for
retreats if there is any possible way to avoid it.  Down
as a retreat doesn't make sense until you're on the Medusa
level far below.



